              "text": "শিক্ষা (shikkhā) is Sanskrit śikṣā, learning or study (Monier-Williams). The everyday verb শেখা, to learn, comes from the same root by the spoken road (CDIAL 12430 śíkṣatē lists Bengali sikhā)."
